@startuml
title MW-05 - AI Task Decomposition

start
:Open AI Copilot;
:Select a project and a task;
:Click "Load";

:Load the chat history and similar past tasks;
:Display the chat and the suggestion context;

:Pick a quick prompt or type a request;
:Send the request with the task details;

:Send the request to the AI;

if (AI busy with another task?) then (Yes)
  :Retry automatically up to 2 times;
  if (AI free now?) then (Yes)
    :Analyze the task and propose subtasks;
    :Estimate durations and show any warning;
    :Display the draft card;
  else (No)
    :Keep waiting and retry;
    stop
  endif
else (No)
  :Analyze the task and propose subtasks;
  :Estimate durations and show any warning;
  :Display the draft card;
endif

:Review and edit the draft;
:Click "Accept and apply subtasks";

:Write the real subtasks to the database;
:Confirm the sync;

stop
@enduml
